{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i><strong>We had to spill the beans</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>We wanted to wait and only release the full name of our game just prior to launch, but Steam required the complete title and we had to oblige in order to lunch this store page. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>Because of this, many of you may have already guessed that\u00a0<strong>TetrX 360,</strong>\u00a0in some fashion, relates to  Tetris. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>Indeed it does,  but <strong>TetrX 360</strong>\u00a0is aimed at a new generation of players. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>It's not a clone. It's a whole new paradigm. A re-imagining of the original for the 21st century. It's monumental.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>So monumental we'll need a full 36 months to release all levels and features planned. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>If you loved the original,\u00a0<strong>TetrX 360</strong> is a <strong>wishlist</strong> must.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TetrX 360</strong>\u00a0<strong>- Eons of Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling puzzle adventure that ignites your strategic instincts! Each level pulses with vivid visuals and an electrifying soundtrack, pushing your quick thinking to the limit as you unlock quirky power-ups and conquer mind-bending challenges. With intuitive game play and endless replayability, this is an addictive experience that captivates casual gamers and puzzle enthusiasts alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetris re-imagined, enhanced and wrapped in grand story line with play modes never thought of before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TetrX 360 includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FEATURE that will make your jaw drop</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30,000+ levels (when fully deployed over the next 36 months)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thousands of variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >millions of combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >truckloads of special items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unheard of game play variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thousands of puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mind bending surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non-linear game play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiplayer challenges\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+ watch out for twists to the purchase price and in-app purchases</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/680c30dbfa6d1053bdc726004df1e001.poster.avif?t=1758711971\" width=225 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/680c30dbfa6d1053bdc726004df1e001.webm?t=1758711971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">awesome new blocks. hundreds\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following initial release, in the ensuing 36 months we'll continue to add new features and levels every three months in the 1st year, every two months in the 2nd year and monthly in the 3rd year, culminating in over 30,000+ playable levels, encapsulated in a grand story that will provide entertainment for many subsequent years to come.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us to make sure you don't miss the release date.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images are actual in-game renderings. We'll be posting actual game play videos and images before release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mean time please see video above for a random selection of art you will encounter once the full 30,000+ levels are deployed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/1fad03837f32ba1bc45f2638020f31ea.poster.avif?t=1758711971\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/1fad03837f32ba1bc45f2638020f31ea.webm?t=1758711971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/1fad03837f32ba1bc45f2638020f31ea.mp4?t=1758711971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Portal. Gateway to all adventures beginning in the 2nd game update. Your access point to 30,000+ levels.</i>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999060?t=1758711971","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999060?t=1758711971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/192e6d8b1dadd02a82f7ceb3d4bf1af2d2a2fafc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758711971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/192e6d8b1dadd02a82f7ceb3d4bf1af2d2a2fafc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758711971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id"